#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:257
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_CantImagineLifeWithoutTrend"
msgid ""
"What's in vogue? Why, it has to be\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”!\p"
"I can't imagine what life would be like\n"
"without “{STR_VAR_1}”!$"
msgstr ""
"现在流行什么？那当然是\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”啦！\p"
"我简直无法想象没有\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”的生活！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:263
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_GettingBoredOfTrend"
msgid ""
"What's in vogue? Why, it has to be\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”!\p"
"But I'm getting kind of bored with it.\p"
"I should look for the next big thing.$"
msgstr ""
"现在流行什么？那当然是\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”啦！\p"
"不过我已经有点腻了。\p"
"我得去找找下一个流行的东西了。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:269
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_TeachingMonAboutTrend"
msgid ""
"I'm teaching my POKéMON about\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1},”\l"
"but it's not going well.\p"
"It's a bit too much, I think.$"
msgstr ""
"我正在教我的宝可梦\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”，\l"
"可是进行得不太顺利。\p"
"我想可能有点太难了吧。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_DeepLinkBetweenXAndY"
msgid ""
"I'm studying up on the hip and trendy\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” now.\p"
"Is it true that there's a deep link\n"
"between “{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"and “{STR_VAR_2}”?$"
msgstr ""
"我现在正在研究最流行的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”。\p"
"听说“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"和“{STR_VAR_2}”\l"
"之间有很深的联系，是真的吗？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_MyHunchWasRight"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"So, my hunch was right!\p"
"I'm one step closer to being hip and\n"
"happening, yowza!$"
msgstr ""
"哦！\n"
"我的直觉果然没错！\p"
"我离走在潮流尖端\n"
"又近了一步，太棒了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:288
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_NotEasyToKeepUp"
msgid ""
"What?!\n"
"Is that so?!\p"
"It's not easy for an older fellow like\n"
"me to keep up with trends!$"
msgstr ""
"什么？！\n"
"是这样吗？！\p"
"对我这种上了年纪的人来说，\n"
"要跟上潮流可真不容易啊！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:294
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_TVShowAboutTrend"
msgid ""
"This whole business about\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”…\l"
"Isn't there a TV show on it?$"
msgstr ""
"关于“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"的这些事……\l"
"电视上是不是有个节目在讲？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:299
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_IsTrendMorePopularAcrossSea"
msgid ""
"Across the sea…\p"
"Is “{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"even more popular?$"
msgstr ""
"在大海的另一边……\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"是不是更受欢迎呢？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_CollectTrendMerchandise"
msgid ""
"I collect official\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"licensed merchandise.\p"
"I have official\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” DOLLS…\p"
"Official “{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"brand clothing…\p"
"And officially licensed\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"picture books.\p"
"Heheh, I own!\n"
"I'm not sharing anything with you!$"
msgstr ""
"我在收集官方授权的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"周边商品。\p"
"我有官方的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”玩偶……\p"
"官方的“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"品牌服装……\p"
"还有官方授权的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"绘本。\p"
"嘿嘿，全都是我的！\n"
"我什么都不会分给你的！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_BooksAboutTrend"
msgid ""
"IDENTIFYING GOOD\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” &\l"
"BAD “{STR_VAR_1}”…\p"
"THE LINK BETWEEN\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” AND\l"
"POKéMON…\p"
"USEFUL\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”…\p"
"It's neatly jammed with books about\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}.”$"
msgstr ""
"《如何分辨好的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”与\l"
"坏的“{STR_VAR_1}”》……\p"
"《“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"与宝可梦的关系》……\p"
"《实用的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”》……\p"
"书架上整整齐齐地塞满了\n"
"关于“{STR_VAR_1}”的书。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:330
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_TrendsScream"
msgid ""
"“{STR_VAR_1}'S\n"
"SCREAM” is the title.$"
msgstr ""
"书名是\n"
"《“{STR_VAR_1}”的呐喊》。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_TrendsSmile"
msgid ""
"“{STR_VAR_1}'S\n"
"SMILE” is the title.$"
msgstr ""
"书名是\n"
"《“{STR_VAR_1}”的微笑》。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:338
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_LastTrend"
msgid ""
"It's titled “THE LAST\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}”.$"
msgstr ""
"书名是\n"
"《最后的“{STR_VAR_1}”》。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:342
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_BirthOfTrend"
msgid ""
"It's titled “THE BIRTH OF\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}”.$"
msgstr ""
"书名是\n"
"《“{STR_VAR_1}”的诞生》。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_SawTrendCoolestThing"
msgid ""
"I saw “{STR_VAR_1}”!\n"
"Cool, huh?\p"
"It's, like, the coolest thing going!\p"
"It was awesome!\n"
"It was the real thing, oh yeah!$"
msgstr ""
"我看到“{STR_VAR_1}”了！\n"
"很酷吧？\p"
"那简直是现在最酷的东西！\p"
"真是太棒了！\n"
"那可是货真价实的哦！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_AllegedTrendNotAuthentic"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, no, no.\p"
"That alleged\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"you claim to have seen--it's not.\p"
"The authentic article is much…\n"
"How should I say it?\l"
"Sharper, yet more mellow!\p"
"Ah, no matter. It's astonishing!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，不不不。\p"
"你说你看到的那个\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”，\l"
"根本不是真的。\p"
"真正的东西要更加……\n"
"该怎么说呢？\l"
"更加锐利，却又更加柔和！\p"
"哎呀，算了。总之很惊人就是了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:363
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_ComposedTrendThemeSong"
msgid ""
"Hey, listen, I composed a theme song\n"
"for “{STR_VAR_1}.”\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"is really popular right now.\p"
"Okay, listen!\n"
"… …\p"
"Oh!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Wonderful\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，听我说，我为“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"写了一首主题曲。\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"现在可是超级流行的。\p"
"好了，仔细听！\n"
"…… ……\p"
"哦！\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"美妙的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_WorkOnYourSinging"
msgid ""
"… …\p"
"I dare say, chap, it would pay for you\n"
"to work on your singing before you\l"
"trifle yourself with\l"
"“{STR_VAR_1}.”$"
msgstr ""
"…… ……\p"
"我说，老兄，在你摆弄\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”之前，\l"
"最好还是先练练\l"
"你的歌喉吧。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_OrganizeTrendParty"
msgid ""
"Anyway, as I was saying earlier, we\n"
"should get together and organize a\l"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” party\l"
"on the island.$"
msgstr ""
"总之，就像我刚才说的，\n"
"我们应该聚在一起，在岛上\l"
"办一场“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"派对。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:388
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_BrilliantIndeed"
msgid ""
"Oh, a smashing good idea!\p"
"It will settle once and for all\n"
"who is the best at\l"
"“{STR_VAR_1}.”\l"
"Brilliant, indeed!\p"
"Starting today, our lives will revolve\n"
"around “{STR_VAR_1}”!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，真是个绝妙的主意！\p"
"这样就能彻底分出\n"
"谁才是\l"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”的第一名了。\l"
"真是太棒了！\p"
"从今天起，我们的生活就要\n"
"围绕着“{STR_VAR_1}”转了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:397
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_TrendHasBecomePartOfLife"
msgid ""
"I was thinking, though…\p"
"Wouldn't you agree that\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” has\l"
"grown from being something trendy to\l"
"being a part of our daily lives?$"
msgstr ""
"不过，我在想……\p"
"你不觉得\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”已经\l"
"从一种流行的东西，\l"
"变成我们日常生活的一部分了吗？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:404
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_TrendWeighsHeavilyOnMind"
msgid ""
"Beg pardon?\n"
"That much, what?\p"
"However, it's true that\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"weighs heavily on your mind, whether\l"
"you're awake or asleep.\p"
"Absolutely, you're the\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"PROFESSOR, old sport!$"
msgstr ""
"你说什么？\n"
"有那么夸张吗？\p"
"不过，不管是醒着还是睡着，\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"确实一直萦绕在你的心头。\p"
"没错，老兄，你就是\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"博士啊！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:415
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_IfWeTeamUpWellBeInvincible"
msgid ""
"If you and me team up as a combo,\n"
"we'll be invincible when it comes to all\l"
"things “{STR_VAR_1}”!$"
msgstr ""
"要是你和我组成搭档，\n"
"在“{STR_VAR_1}”方面\l"
"我们就天下无敌了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:420
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_WellBeTrendDuo"
msgid ""
"Spot on, my friend!\p"
"We shall be the\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” DUO!\p"
"Isn't that a ripe image?\n"
"Hahahah!$"
msgstr ""
"说得太对了，朋友！\p"
"我们就是\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”二人组！\p"
"这形象是不是很棒？\n"
"哈哈哈哈！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:427
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_GiveYouSludgeBomb"
msgid ""
"For me, SLUDGE BOMB is at the peak\n"
"of popularity. It's the one.\p"
"Hunh? You're telling me that you don't\n"
"know about SLUDGE BOMB?\p"
"That's outright pitiful.\n"
"I'll give you one.$"
msgstr ""
"对我来说，污泥炸弹\n"
"是最受欢迎的。就是它了。\p"
"哈？你说你不知道\n"
"污泥炸弹是什么？\p"
"那也太可怜了。\n"
"我送你一个吧。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Hall/scripts.inc:435
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Hall_Text_LoveSludgeBombButTrendInToo"
msgid ""
"I love SLUDGE BOMB.\p"
"But POKéMON with the move\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"are in, too.$"
msgstr ""
"我最喜欢污泥炸弹了。\p"
"不过，会“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"这个招式的宝可梦\l"
"也很流行哦。$"
